{
    "id": "T1578-ModifyCloudComputeInfrastructure",
    "name": "Modify Cloud Compute Infrastructure",
    "description": "An adversary may attempt to modify a cloud account's compute service infrastructure to evade defenses. A modification to the compute service infrastructure can include the creation, deletion, or modification of one or more components such as compute instances, virtual machines, and snapshots. Permissions gained from the modification of infrastructure components may bypass restrictions that prevent access to existing infrastructure. Modifying infrastructure components may also allow an adversary to evade detection and remove evidence of their presence.",
    "severity": "high",
    "mitre_attack": {
        "tactic": "TA0005",
        "technique_id": "T1578",
        "subtechnique_id": "",
        "data_sources": [
            "Enterprise:Defense Evasion:Modify Cloud Compute Infrastructure:Create Snapshot",
            "Enterprise:Defense Evasion:Modify Cloud Compute Infrastructure:Delete Snapshot",
            "Enterprise:Defense Evasion:Modify Cloud Compute Infrastructure:Create Cloud Instance",
            "Enterprise:Defense Evasion:Modify Cloud Compute Infrastructure:Delete Cloud Instance",
            "Enterprise:Defense Evasion:Modify Cloud Compute Infrastructure:Modify Cloud Compute Configurations"
        ]
    },
    "platform": [
        "windows"
    ],
    "detection": {
        "selections": {
            "s1_process_create_action": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.action",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "create"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s2_cloud_cli_tool_execution": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "az.exe"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "aws.exe"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "gcloud.exe"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s3_snapshot_management_commands": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "snapshot create"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "snapshot delete"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 create-snapshot"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 delete-snapshot"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute snapshots create"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute snapshots delete"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s4_instance_management_commands": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "instance create"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "instance delete"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "instance stop"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "instance start"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "instance modify"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 run-instances"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 terminate-instances"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 stop-instances"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 start-instances"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 modify-instance-attribute"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute instances create"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute instances delete"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute instances stop"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute instances start"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute instances set-metadata"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s5_volume_management_commands": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "volume create"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "volume delete"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 create-volume"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "ec2 delete-volume"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute disks create"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "compute disks delete"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "condition": "s1_process_create_action and s2_cloud_cli_tool_execution and (s3_snapshot_management_commands or s4_instance_management_commands or s5_volume_management_commands)"
    },
    "operational_usage": "SOC 팀은 이 규칙을 활용하여 클라우드 컴퓨팅 인프라 변경 시도를 탐지할 수 있습니다. `az.exe`, `aws.exe`, `gcloud.exe`와 같은 클라우드 CLI 도구의 실행과 함께 스냅샷, 인스턴스, 볼륨 생성/삭제/수정 명령줄 인자를 모니터링합니다. 탐지된 이벤트는 높은 심각도로 분류되어 즉각적인 알람을 트리거하고, 관련 계정 및 활동에 대한 추가적인 포렌식 조사를 시작하는 데 사용될 수 있습니다. 특히, 방어 회피 또는 자원 고갈 공격과 결합될 때 중요도가 더욱 높아집니다.",
    "false_positive": "정상적인 클라우드 관리 작업, 자동화 스크립트, CI/CD 파이프라인, 또는 개발/테스트 환경에서 클라우드 리소스를 프로비저닝하거나 해제하는 과정에서 오탐이 발생할 수 있습니다. 알려진 정상적인 클라우드 CLI 호출 패턴이나 특정 사용자/서비스 계정에 대해 화이트리스트를 적용하여 오탐을 줄일 수 있습니다."
}